## Buying a refurbished Lenovo ThinkPad

ThinkPads have one of the most loyal followings of any laptop line. People who use them tend to keep buying them — mainly because of the keyboard, the build quality and how easy they are to repair and upgrade. Those same qualities make refurbished ThinkPads an excellent long-term investment.

### Understanding the ThinkPad series

- **T series** — the classic business workhorse. The **T480**, **T490** and **T14** are among the most popular refurbished laptops for good reason: solid build, comfortable keyboards and good performance.
- **X series** — thinner and lighter. The **X1 Carbon** is the premium ultralight flagship; the X200-series models are compact 12–13 inch options.
- **E series** — Lenovo's affordable business line, fine for study and office work.
- **L series** — value business models focused on durability and serviceability.
- **P series** — mobile workstations with professional graphics for engineering and design.

**IdeaPad** and **Yoga** models are Lenovo's consumer range, and **Legion** is its gaming line.

### What makes ThinkPads different

- **Keyboards** with good key travel and spacing, and spill-resistant designs on many models.
- The **TrackPoint** pointing stick in the middle of the keyboard, plus a regular touchpad.
- **Serviceability** — on many T-series models, memory, storage and battery are straightforward to replace.
- **Durability** — Lenovo states that many ThinkPad models are tested against MIL-STD-810 methods.

### What to check

1. Processor generation — 8th generation or newer for Windows 11 support.
2. Whether RAM is fully soldered (common on some slimmer models) or upgradeable.
3. Screen resolution and brightness.
4. Measured battery health — listed on every product page.

All our ThinkPads pass our [nine-step refurbishment process](/how-we-refurbish) and are graded against our published [condition grades](/condition-grades). Compare ThinkPads with Latitude and EliteBook in our [business laptop guide](/blog/best-business-laptops-for-professionals).
